  "question": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> are converted to mono cations <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> and <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> respectively. The wrong statement with respect to given changes in the following is",
