  "solution": {
    "text": "B.O or <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> and <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math>  <br/><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/4bac1f90-7d38-4efa-a227-cb99085f7bf4.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.5in;height:0.575in\"> <br/>As here bond order decreases so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> bond get weak <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> becomes paramagnetic <br/>In case of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  <br/>B.O or <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math>  <br/>as bond order increases so <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> bond length decreases.",
